/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 187 0 R
/E (We are glad for the first quarter of the year, as it brings new opportunities and fresh perspectives.As we reflect on the achievements of the past months, we look forward to building on these successes and facing new challenges with enthusiasm and determination. It is a time for growth, both personally and as a Church in general, and we are excited to see what the rest of the year holds for us.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 187 0 R
/E (I want to thank God for the far He has brought us as a church and for the growth we've experienced. As the leader of Cornerstone Family Chapel, I have witnessed firsthand the dedication and commitment of our congregation. Each member has played a vital role in fostering a loving and supportive community that reflects God's love and grace. Through our collective efforts, we have not only deepened our faith but also reached out to those in need, sharing the message of hope and salvation. It is a blessing to see our ministries flourish, and I am excited about the future that God has in store for us as we continue to serve Him and one another with open hearts and open minds. Let us keep pressing forward and striving for excellence in all that we do, knowing that with God at the center, we can achieve great things together.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
