/E (This profound conference dubbed Epik \(Equipping Pastors in Kenya\) has been of great success, having been held in previous years. Each iteration brings together pastors and church leaders from various backgrounds, fostering an environment of learning, collaboration, and spiritual growth. Attendees have found the workshops and keynote speeches particularly enriching, as they address pressing issues in ministry and provide practical tools for effective leadership. The sense of community that develops throughout the conference encourages ongoing relationships among participants, paving the way for future partnerships and support networks. As we look forward to this year's event, the excitement is palpable, with a lineup of esteemed speakers and innovative sessions designed to inspire and equip the next generation of church leaders.)
/Pg 12 0 R
