/E (We thank God for the Praise & Worship team that has given themselves in the ministry, dedicating their time, talents, and hearts to uplift our spirits and lead us into His presence. Their commitment to honing their skills and creating an atmosphere of worship reflects their deep love for God and their desire to serve the congregation. Through their melodies and harmonies, they inspire us to connect with the divine, fostering a sense of community and shared faith. We appreciate their hard work behind the scenes, from selecting songs to rehearsing tirelessly, all to ensure that our worship experience is meaningful and impactful. May they continue to be blessed as they bless others.)
