/P 833 0 R
/E (A few months ago we hoped to complete the setup of our clinic, but due to a shortage of finances, the project stalled. We are eager to serve our community better through this clinic, providing essential health services that are greatly needed. It is disheartening to see this initiative on hold, as it has the potential to make a significant impact on many lives. We believe that with the right resources, we can offer support for various health challenges faced by our members and neighbors, promoting overall wellness.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
