/Title (We had a wonderful time in learning the Word of God going through different study materials and through the Leadership of Christine Wahome. We've seen great impact as we delved deeper into the scriptures, discussing various passages and their applications in our daily lives. The enriching conversations fostered a sense of community among us, and we were able to share our insights and personal experiences, which further strengthened our understanding of God's teachings. Each session brought new revelations and encouraged us to apply what we learned in our own lives, fostering spiritual growth and a stronger faith as we journeyed together in this learning process.)
